<title>USA: AVIC Group appoints McNamar to board.</title>
<headline>AVIC Group appoints McNamar to board.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>AVIC Group International Inc said on Thursday it appointed Tim McNamar to the newly created position of vice chairman, which increases the number of board posts to seven.</p>
<p>McNamar, a former deputy secretary of the U.S. Treasury during the Reagan administration, will help AVIC in its telecommunications activities in China.  -- New York Newsroom 212 859 1610</p>
